Package: crocotel
Type: Package
Title: Context-Resolved Trans-eQTL Mapping via Genetically Regulated Expression
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Brunilda", "Balliu", email = "bballiu@g.ucla.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Builds cross-validated genetically regulated expression (GReX)
    predictors using a CONTENT-style shared/context-specific decomposition and
    an elastic net, then maps trans-eQTLs by testing regulator GReX against
    target expression with hierarchical (treeQTL-style) FDR control. Includes
    simulation utilities, memory-mapped (bigSNP) genotype ingest, and
    MatrixEQTL-based association scans.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
